---Used in tooltips to set the tooltip category. It is also used to get the locale keys for activation instructions and speed of the action for the tooltip.
---
---For example, an activation\_type of "throw" will result in the tooltip category "thrown" and the tooltip locale keys "gui.instruction-to-throw" and "description.throwing-speed".
---
---[View Documentation](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/types/BaseAttackParameters.html%23activation_type#activation_type)
---@field activation_type? ("shoot")|("throw")|("consume")|("activate")
---@
