---@field movement_slow_down_factor? double
---@
---
---Before an entity can attack, the distance (in tiles) between the entity and target must be less than or equal to this.
---
---[View Documentation](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/types/BaseAttackParameters.html%23range#range)
---@field range float
