---
---A higher penalty will discourage turrets from targeting units that would take longer to turn to face.
---
---[View Documentation](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/types/BaseAttackParameters.html%23rotate_penalty#rotate_penalty)
---@field rotate_penalty? float
