---
---Played once at the start of the attack if these are [ProjectileAttackParameters](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/types/ProjectileAttackParameters.html).
---
---[View Documentation](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/types/BaseAttackParameters.html%23sound#sound)
---@field sound? LayeredSound
